# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""read_file() tren file co ket thuc dong CRLF - LECH giua hai phia.

Python `open(p, 'r')` dung "universal newlines": moi '\r\n' tren dia ve
bo nho thanh '\n'. TokenVector anh xa read_file thang sang
System.IO.File::ReadAllText, KHONG dich gi ca - '\r' con nguyen.

Hau qua: cung mot file, `len(read_file(p))` cho hai so khac nhau, va moi
phep dem dong/token/bam chuoi deu lech theo. Khong loi, khong exception.

Phat hien 2026-08-04 khi dung _tkv_arbiter cho ctxpack: phia CPython bao
600 token, phia bien dich bao 698 - dung bang so ky tu '\r'.
"""
from _file_io_helpers import read_file


def char_count(path: "str") -> "str":
    s = read_file(path)
    return str(len(s))
